# Dahlia: onnxruntime-node's install script downloads ONNX Runtime's Linux CUDA build from the releases of
# github.com/microsoft/onnxruntime. Microsoft made that repository private on 2026-11-17 while it investigates
# malicious content, so the download fails with 404 and every install on Linux stopped. Nothing Dahlia ships
# uses those files: the Windows app runs ONNX Runtime with DirectML from the npm package, and the Android app
# doesn't use onnxruntime-node. If a Linux CUDA build is ever needed, Microsoft's signed NuGet package
# Microsoft.ML.OnnxRuntime.Gpu.Linux has the same files (checked byte for byte for 1.21.0 on 2026-11-18).
onnxruntime-node-install-cuda=skip
